# The repo is edited from both Windows (UNC into WSL) and Linux. Workflow and
# shell files MUST stay LF: CRLF in a GitHub Actions workflow or a bash script
# is a known source of parse/exec failures.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
